  "The connection to the torrent engine dropped mid-stream.": "Naputol ang koneksyon sa torrent engine sa gitna ng stream.",
  "The device this was cast from answered HTTP {status}. It may have stopped serving the film.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: The device this was cast from answered HTTP {status}. It may have stopped serving the film.",
  "The device this was cast from couldn't be reached. Check it is still on and on this network.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: The device this was cast from couldn't be reached. Check it is still on and on this network.",
  "The download couldn't be started.": "Hindi masimulan ang pag-download.",
  "The download didn't finish.": "Hindi natapos ang pag-download.",
  "The exception is Dolby or DTS handed straight to a receiver over HDMI, which Android does where it can — nothing in the app touches that sound, so neither setting has any effect on it. An amplifier doing that has a night mode of its own.": "Ang eksepsiyon ay ang Dolby o DTS na dumidiretso sa receiver sa pamamagitan ng HDMI, na ginagawa ng Android kung kaya nito — walang bahagi ng app ang humahawak sa tunog na iyon, kaya walang epekto rito ang alinmang setting. May sariling night mode ang amplifier na gumagawa niyon.",
  "The film is played as it was mixed.": "Tumutugtog ang pelikula gaya ng pagkakahalo nito.",
  "The link this source gave answered HTTP {status}. It may have expired — search the sources again for a fresh one.": "Ang link na ibinigay ng pinagmumulan na ito ay tumugon ng HTTP {status}. Maaaring nag-expire na ito — maghanap muli sa mga pinagmumulan para sa bago.",
  "The link this source gave could not be reached.": "Hindi maabot ang link na ibinigay ng pinagmumulang ito.",
  "The other device refused the film.": "Tinanggihan ng kabilang device ang pelikula.",
  "The other device streams this film from here, so nothing is downloaded twice. Both have to be on the same network, and it has to be switched on for casting under Settings → Network.": "Kinukuha ng kabilang device ang pelikulang ito mula rito, kaya walang nadadownload nang dalawang beses. Kailangang nasa iisang network silang dalawa, at doon kailangang nakabukas ang pagpapadala sa ilalim ng Mga Setting → Network.",
  "The picture currently behind the app": "Ang larawang kasalukuyang nasa likod ng app",
  "The player area never got a size, so playback was not started.": "Hindi kailanman nakakuha ng laki ang bahagi ng player, kaya hindi sinimulan ang pag-play.",
  "The player itself — decoding, subtitles and audio. GPLv2 or later.": "Ang player mismo — pag-decode, mga subtitle at audio. GPLv2 o mas bago.",
  "The project does not host, run, endorse or recommend any source, and does not distribute a list of them.": "Hindi nagho-host, hindi nagpapatakbo, hindi nag-e-endorso at hindi nagrerekomenda ang proyekto ng anumang pinagmumulan, at hindi rin ito namamahagi ng listahan ng mga ito.",
  "The project on GitHub": "Ang proyekto sa GitHub",
  "The release carries no update for this platform.": "Walang dalang update ang release na ito para sa platform na ito.",
  "The source fetched this already — it plays at once and keeps nothing on this device": "Nakuha na ito ng pinagmumulan — agad itong pine-play at walang iniiwan sa device na ito",
  "The supporter list couldn't be loaded — the Ko-fi page above has the current one.": "Hindi ma-load ang listahan ng mga tumutulong — nasa Ko-fi page sa itaas ang kasalukuyan.",
  "The torrent engine accepted the magnet but gave it no id.": "Tinanggap ng torrent engine ang magnet pero walang ibinigay na id dito.",
  "The torrent engine, embedded in the app. MIT licensed.": "Ang torrent engine, nakapaloob sa app. Naka-lisensya sa MIT.",
  "The torrent stream isn't ready yet (engine replied HTTP {status}). It may still be fetching metadata from peers.": "Hindi pa handa ang torrent stream (tumugon ang engine ng HTTP {status}). Maaaring kumukuha pa ito ng metadata mula sa mga peer.",
  "The update couldn't be installed: {error}": "Hindi ma-install ang update: {error}",
  "Theme": "Tema",
  "There is barely room for one film here. Plug a USB drive into the box — formatted FAT32, which every Android box accepts — and it appears above to download onto instead.": "Halos hindi kasya rito ang isang pelikula. Magsaksak ng USB drive sa box — naka-format sa FAT32, na tinatanggap ng bawat Android box — at lilitaw ito sa itaas para doon na lang mag-download.",
  "There is no account to sign in to and nothing syncs to a server. What you watch, how far you got, your favourites and your watchlist are all stored on this device and never leave it. Syncing between screens is planned; until then, the backup below is how a library moves.": "Walang account na malo-log in at walang sinu-sync sa anumang server. Ang pinapanood mo, kung hanggang saan ka na, ang mga paborito mo at ang watchlist mo ay lahat nakaimbak sa device na ito at hindi kailanman umaalis dito. Nakaplano ang pag-sync sa pagitan ng mga screen; hanggang doon, ang backup sa ibaba ang paraan para mailipat ang isang library.",
  "There's no {file} in your documents folder. Copy one there and try again.": "Walang {file} sa iyong documents folder. Kumopya ng isa roon at subukan muli.",
  "This connection is metered right now.": "Metered ang koneksyong ito sa ngayon.",
  "This connection is not metered right now.": "Hindi metered ang koneksyong ito sa ngayon.",
  "This copy wasn't installed by Ventic's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.": "Hindi ang sariling installer ng Ventic ang nag-install ng kopyang ito — isang package manager, o build mula sa source — kaya kung ano man ang naglagay nito roon ang siyang mag-a-update nito. Ang pagpapalit ng mga file mula rito ay makakalito lang dito.",
  "This device couldn't start serving the film to the network.": "Hindi nasimulan ng device na ito na ibigay ang pelikula sa network.",
  "This device is called": "Ang pangalan ng device na ito ay",
  "This device is streaming a film to another one right now.": "Nagpapadala ngayon ang device na ito ng pelikula sa iba.",
  "This device is streaming a film to {device} right now.": "Nagpapadala ngayon ang device na ito ng pelikula sa {device}.",
  "This device is streaming the film to it. Leave Ventic running until you're done — closing it stops the stream.": "Ipinapadala ng device na ito ang pelikula doon. Huwag isara ang Ventic hanggang matapos ka — kapag isinara mo, hihinto ang pagpapadala.",
  "This device isn't on a network Ventic can see. Type the other device's address instead.": "Wala ang device na ito sa network na nakikita ng Ventic. I-type na lang ang address ng kabilang device.",
  "This device's decoder gave up on the file. That is usually the audio: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) and DTS are not licensed into the system webview, so a release carrying one plays as a picture with no sound, or not at all. An x264 release with AAC audio will play.": "Sumuko ang decoder ng device na ito sa file. Kadalasan ay ang audio ang dahilan: hindi naka-lisensya sa system webview ang Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) at DTS, kaya ang release na may isa sa mga iyon ay lalabas na larawang walang tunog, o hindi lalabas man lang. Mapapatugtog ang x264 release na may AAC audio.",
  "This file has one audio track.": "May isang audio track ang file na ito.",
  "Timing": "Timing",
  "Tint": "Tint",
  "Title": "Pamagat",
