  "Use this colour": "Gamitin ang kulay na ito",
  "Using the usual audio settings": "Ginagamit ang karaniwang mga setting ng audio",
  "Ventic": "Ventic",
  "Ventic TV": "Ventic TV",
  "Ventic asks a source for {movie}, or {series}, and expects a {streams} array back. Add several and their results are merged, with duplicates dropped and earlier sources preferred.": "Hinihingi ng Ventic sa isang pinagmumulan ang {movie}, o {series}, at umaasa itong makakuha ng {streams} array. Magdagdag ng ilan at pagsasamahin ang mga resulta nila, aalisin ang mga duplicate at uunahin ang mga naunang pinagmumulan.",
  "Ventic collects nothing about you: no account, no telemetry, no crash reports and no server to send them to. The privacy policy lists every request the app makes and every permission it asks for.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: Ventic collects nothing about you: no account, no telemetry, no crash reports and no server to send them to. The privacy policy lists every request the app makes and every permission it asks for.",
  "Ventic downloads the new package and Android asks you to confirm the install. It is signed with the same key as the copy you have, so it upgrades in place and keeps your library.": "Dina-download ng Ventic ang bagong package at hihilingin ng Android na kumpirmahin mo ang pag-install. Nilagdaan ito ng parehong susi ng kopyang mayroon ka, kaya nag-a-upgrade ito sa mismong kinalalagyan at nananatili ang library mo.",
  "Ventic has no sources configured, so there is nowhere to search. You can still play a magnet or a torrent file you open yourself.": "Walang naka-configure na pinagmumulan ang Ventic, kaya wala itong mahahanapan. Puwede mo pa ring i-play ang isang magnet o torrent file na ikaw mismo ang nagbukas.",
  "Ventic hosts no content, indexes no content, and ships with no sources configured. It is a BitTorrent client with a player attached: it fetches only what you point it at, from servers you added yourself.": "Walang nilalamang hino-host ang Ventic, walang ini-index, at walang naka-configure na pinagmumulan pagdating nito. Isa itong BitTorrent client na may kasamang player: kinukuha lang nito ang itinuturo mo, mula sa mga server na ikaw mismo ang nagdagdag.",
  "Ventic is MIT licensed. The components it is built on keep their own terms, listed above; on Windows the bundled mpv is GPL software and its licence and offer of source sit next to the application's executable.": "Naka-lisensya sa MIT ang Ventic. Pinananatili ng mga bahaging pinagbuuan nito ang sarili nilang mga tuntunin, nakalista sa itaas; sa Windows, GPL software ang kasamang mpv at nasa tabi ng executable ng app ang lisensya nito at ang alok ng source code.",
  "Ventic is free, has no ads, no account and nothing to sell. It costs money to sign, host and keep running — a donation is what covers that, and nothing in the app changes whether you give one or not.": "Libre ang Ventic, walang ads, walang account at walang ibinebenta. May gastos ang pagpirma, pag-host at pagpapatakbo nito — iyon ang sinasagot ng donasyon, at walang nagbabago sa app kung magbibigay ka man o hindi.",
  "Ventic is up to date.": "Napapanahon na ang Ventic.",
  "Ventic keeps your library on this device. Carrying it to another screen is the backup file below.": "Iniingatan ng Ventic ang library mo sa device na ito. Ang backup file sa ibaba ang paraan para dalhin ito sa ibang screen.",
  "Ventic searches nothing by itself. A source is a URL you add here, pointing at a server that answers with things to play. What a source offers, and whether you have the right to play it, is between you and whoever runs it.": "Walang hinahanap ang Ventic nang mag-isa. Ang pinagmumulan ay isang URL na idinaragdag mo rito, na nakaturo sa isang server na sumasagot ng mga bagay na mapapanood. Kung ano ang inaalok ng isang pinagmumulan, at kung may karapatan ka bang panoorin iyon, ay usapan mo at ng kung sino man ang nagpapatakbo nito.",
  "Ventic speaks the {protocol}. Any Stremio addon URL works here — paste the {link} link or the {manifest} address and it'll be trimmed to what's needed.": "Nagsasalita ang Ventic ng {protocol}. Gumagana rito ang anumang URL ng Stremio addon — i-paste ang {link} na link o ang {manifest} na address at puputulin ito hanggang sa kung ano lang ang kailangan.",
  "Ventic will send it the title you're looking for and play what it hands back. Only add servers you trust — this one is not run by, or checked by, this app.": "Ipapadala rito ng Ventic ang pamagat na hinahanap mo at ipe-play ang ibinabalik nito. Magdagdag lang ng mga server na pinagkakatiwalaan mo — hindi ito pinapatakbo o sinusuri ng app na ito.",
  "Ventic {version} is out": "Lumabas na ang Ventic {version}",
  "Version {version}": "Bersyon {version}",
