  "{device} couldn't open that link. It may have expired, or that device may have no connection of its own.": "Hindi nabuksan ng {device} ang link na iyon. Baka nag-expire na, o baka walang sariling koneksyon ang device na iyon.",
  "{device} couldn't reach this device — a firewall here is blocking port {port}.": "Hindi naabot ng {device} ang device na ito — may firewall dito na humaharang sa port {port}.",
